  "proof": {
    "geometry": "Specific world degrees replace target aiming; later constant-spread override retained. Normal bullets are script default; Meca laser and Mutant acid remain source facts only. Mother Collision nodes have uniform scale2; child position itself is not multiplied.",
    "armor": "Unit.reset_armor_stat rounds base+increment*(wave-1); Unit.get_damage_value subtracts flat armor with minimum1. BurningTimer explicitly disables armor. Real structure burn and actual weapon burn queue cover forwarding.",
    "rootBinding": "Both bound root scripts declare is_full and a detection zone, but do not connect or implement eating. No invented heal/full change. Sprite flip/render/animation pooling remain open.",
    "boost": "Source enemy.tscn defaults can_be_boosted=true, mother scene overrides false. Actual CorruptedBuffer leaves mother at35HP and boosts the child from7to18; initial repro88HP.",
    "charmRounding": "Native Charm resets damage with its200-percent modifier and EntityService rounds after that modifier. Preserve raw per-wave contact/projectile bases for the new rounding-enabled kinds; round(11.8*3)=35, not round(11.8)*3=36. Actual eight-direction charmed mother probe first reproduced36."
  },
